                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 11,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Hospitals are meant to save lives, not ruin them. But some doctors are conducting irreversible chemical and surgical mutilation on minors, which are often irreversible, in the name of \u201cgender-affirming care.\u201d This is a dangerous practice with potentially harmful long-term effects on a child\u2019s growth. The Trump Administration has said they could begin taking steps to align CMS policies with medical evidence that these procedures are harmful. I applaud this progress to keep our children safe. https://t.co/bPRhkJc9Xt",
