                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Thank you to the staff and patients I met with at Ortonville Area Health Services. Their hospital still offers labor and delivery services, something that is becoming increasingly rare in our rural hospitals. They are also one of the many providers who could be negatively affected if Biden\u2019s nursing staff ratio mandate were to go into effect. I introduced legislation that was included in the One Big Beautiful Bill would keep that from happening.",
